      "ref": "BDB, אַלְמָנָה",
      "preview": "אַלְמָנָה: viúva; usos sociais, legais e figurados, e proteção de Deus.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנָה</span></big><sub>54</sub>  <strong>s.f. viúva (</strong>mishnaico <em>idem</em>, assírio <em>almattu</em> Dl em Zim<sup>BP 114</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:11\" href=\"/Genesis.38.11\">Gn 38:11</a> +; sem estado construto; plural. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:23\" href=\"/Exodus.22.23\">Ex 22:23</a> +; plural com sufixo. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמְנֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 27:15\" href=\"/Job.27.15\">Jb 27:15</a>, etc. — <em>viúva</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.20\">1 K 17:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה אַ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.5\">2 S 14:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫מָת אִישִׁי</span>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.14\">1 K 7:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.26\">11:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.9\">17:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:11\" href=\"/Genesis.38.11\">Gn 38:11</a> (J; vivendo na casa do pai); cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.13\">Lv 22:13</a> (H; em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרוּשָׁה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.14\">21:14</a> (H), onde é vedado ao sumo sacerdote tomar viúva por esposa, assim como <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרוּשָׁה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלָלָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹנָה</span>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.22\">Ez 44:22</a><sup>(×3)</sup> (<em>idem</em> para todos os sacerdotes, exceto a viúva de um sacerdote); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:10\" href=\"/Numbers.30.10\">Nu 30:10</a> (P; acerca do voto da viúva, em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרוּשָׁה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">נְשֵׁיכֶם אַלְמָנוֹת</span> = sereis mortos <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:23\" href=\"/Exodus.22.23\">Ex 22:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵיכֶם יְתֹמִים</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:9\" href=\"/Psalms.109.9\">ψ 109:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.8\">Je 15:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.21\">18:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.25\">Ez 22:25</a>, também <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.3\">La 5:3</a> (em comparação); acerca das mulheres cujos maridos foram arrebatados pela peste <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמְנוֹתָיו לֹא תִבְכֶּינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 27:15\" href=\"/Job.27.15\">Jb 27:15</a>; pela espada, <em>idem</em>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:64\" href=\"/Psalms.78.64\">ψ 78:64</a>; 𝔊 e We leem <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנוֹת חַיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.3\">2 S 20:3</a> (ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַלְמָנוּת\" href=\"/BDB,_אַלְמָנוּת\", dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנוּת</a> abaixo), acerca das concubinas mantidas reclusas; figuradamente, de Jerusalém <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:1\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.1\">La 1:1</a>; de Babilônia <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.8\">Is 47:8</a>; especialmente a viúva enquanto desamparada, exposta à opressão e ao tratamento cruel (frequentemente em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">יָתוֹם</span>, & <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.23\">Is 1:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">10:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:9\" href=\"/Job.22.9\">Jb 22:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:3\" href=\"/Job.24.3\">24:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:16\" href=\"/Job.31.16\">31:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:6\" href=\"/Psalms.94.6\">ψ 94:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:5\" href=\"/Malachi.3.5\">Mal 3:5</a>; a crueldade contra elas é proibida, e ordena-se que sejam amparadas <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:21\" href=\"/Exodus.22.21\">Ex 22:21</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.29\">Dt 14:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.11\">16:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.17\">24:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.12\">26:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.19\">27:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.17\">Is 1:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.6\">Je 7:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.3\">22:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.10\">Zc 7:10</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 29:13\" href=\"/Job.29.13\">Jb 29:13</a>; sob o cuidado especial de Deus <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.18\">Dt 10:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.11\">Je 49:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.25\">Pr 15:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:6\" href=\"/Psalms.68.6\">ψ 68:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:9\" href=\"/Psalms.146.9\">146:9</a>; uma vez, acerca da severidade do juízo, que não poupa a viúva <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.16\">Is 9:16</a>. (<span dir=\"rtl\">אַל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.22\">Is 13:22</a> ver sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַרְמוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַרְמוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַרְמוֹן</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.7\">Ez 19:7</a> ver <em>ibidem</em>)",
