      "html": "† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָלַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: aprender (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أَلِفَ</span> <em>permanecer, apegar-se a, tornar-se familiarizado com;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲלַף</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܝܺܠܶܦ</span>, <em>aprender</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܠܶܦ</span>, pael <em>ensinar</em><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>Qal</strong> imperfeito, segunda pessoa do masculino singular. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּאְלַף אֹרְחֹתָו֯</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.25\">Pr 22:25</a>;<br><strong>Piel</strong>  <strong>ensinar</strong>, seguido de acusativo. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְאַלֵּף פִּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:5\" href=\"/Job.15.5\">Jb 15:5</a> (sujeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲוֹנְךָ</span>); assim, particípio. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְּפֵנוּ</span> (por <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאַלְּ׳</span> Sta<sup>§ 111, 3</sup> Kö<sup>I, 388</sup> Ge<sup>§ 68 fin.</sup>, cf. Ew<sup>§ 73 b</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Job 35:11\" href=\"/Job.35.11\">Jb 35:11</a>; seguido de dois acusativos. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲאַלֶּפְךָ חָכְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:33\" href=\"/Job.33.33\">Jb 33:33</a>.",
