      "headword": "אַלּוּף",
      "ref": "BDB, אַלּוּף",
      "preview": "אַלּוּף (I): domesticado, dócil; amigo íntimo; vacas.",
      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּף</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo: domesticado</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> forma absoluta. <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:5\" href=\"/Micah.7.5\">Mi 7:5</a> +; estado construto. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.17\">Pr 2:17</a> +; com sufixo. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּפִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:14\" href=\"/Psalms.55.14\">ψ 55:14</a>; plural. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלֻּפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.21\">Je 13:21</a>, com sufixo. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּפֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:14\" href=\"/Psalms.144.14\">ψ 144:14</a>, etc.; — <br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>domesticado, dócil</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּבֶשׂ אַלּוּף</span> <em>dócil</em> (manso) <em>cordeiro</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.19\">Je 11:19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>s.m.</strong> <em>amigo, íntimo</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:14\" href=\"/Psalms.55.14\">ψ 55:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְיֻדָּע</span>) <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:5\" href=\"/Micah.7.5\">Mi 7:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵעַ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.28\">Pr 16:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.9\">17:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.21\">Je 13:21</a>; acerca do marido de uma mulher <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ נְעוּרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.17\">Pr 2:17</a>; figuradamente, de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> como marido de Judá, <em>idem</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.4\">Je 3:4</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong> equivalente a I. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלֶף</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּפֵינוּ מְסֻבָּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:14\" href=\"/Psalms.144.14\">ψ 144:14</a> (isto é, vacas).",
